Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,School notices can hide the next step\Nin a wall of unfamiliar words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,School Notice Decoder turns a photo\Ninto a plan for multilingual families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fictional school notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tesseract reads the image in the browser,\Nand the parent can correct the text.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Before optional AI analysis,\Nthe student’s name is masked locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The exact outgoing text\Nremains visible for review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The no-key demo uses a clearly labeled sample engine,\Nnot a live AI response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Spanish instructions\Nbecome checkable actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every task links back to its source.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Calendar dates stay editable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Only after a parent checks them can an all-day reminder\Nfile be downloaded. No timezone is guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gemini is optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The prototype allows synthetic, non-sensitive content only,\Nand explains its free-tier data use.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The goal is not another translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a next step a family can inspect,\Nunderstand, and act on.
